#: ../../source/docs/common-auxiliary-functions.rst:11
#: 5160e7a3f3dd4781ab81c5cfa4b4e77e
msgid ""
"Any RC input channel can be assigned any auxiliary function. However, the RC"
" channel should not be used by any other function, such as flight mode "
"selection or flight controls. By default, channels 1-6 are used for flight "
"controls (i.e. pitch, roll, vertical, yaw, forward, and lateral), and "
"channels 7 and 8 are used for camera mount gimbal yaw and pitch control. "
"There is no default flight mode channel."
msgstr ""
"任意 RC 输入通道均可分配任意辅助功能。但该 RC 通道不应被其他功能占用，例如飞行模式选择或飞行控制。默认情况下，通道 1-6 "
"用于飞行控制（即俯仰、横滚、垂直、偏航、前进和侧移），通道 7 和 8 用于摄像头云台偏航和俯仰控制。没有默认的飞行模式通道。"
